    "base": "the authored base materials (goblin parts are built in these and nothing else for walls, roofs and trim): jungle for timber walls, planks, doors, trapdoors, fences and scaffolding posts; waxed weathered copper (cut copper and its stairs and slabs, copper grates, copper trapdoors, copper doors, copper bulbs) for roof sheeting and patch plates; iron_block, iron_bars, iron_trapdoor and chain for riveted metal, cranes and rails; polished_blackstone_bricks (and its stairs, slabs, walls) for foundations, piers and smokestacks; gold_block for trim and signs; lanterns, sea_lantern and verdant_froglight for the green glow; barrels and scaffolding; the yard surface red_sand and dead_bush (markers the placer swaps for the land's ground and plant)",
